{"seq":3,"slug":"neurosurgery","title":"大学临床医学 — 神经外科","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/surgery/neurosurgery","wordCount":1866,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学临床医学-神经外科\">大学临床医学 — 神经外科</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>神经外科处理中枢和周围神经系统的手术性疾病，核心领域包括颅脑创伤、颅内肿瘤、脑血管病（动脉瘤和脑出血）和功能性神经外科。与其他外科亚专科不同，神经外科的操作空间极其狭小——脑组织不可再生，手术精度以毫米计。理解颅内压（ICP）动力学和脑疝机制是掌握神经外科急症的必备基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"颅内压与脑疝\">颅内压与脑疝</h3><p>正常成人颅内压（ICP）为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>15</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mmHg</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\text{-}15\\,\\text{mmHg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mmHg</span></span></span></span></span></span>（或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>70</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>200</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub><mtext>mmH</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>O</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">70\\text{-}200\\,\\text{mmH}_2\\text{O}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mmH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span></span></span></span></span>）。颅腔是刚性容器，其内容物由三部分组成：脑组织（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span>）、脑脊液（CSF，约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span></span></span>）和血液（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span></span></span>）。根据 <strong>Monroe-Kellie 假说</strong>，三者总体积恒定——当一种成分体积增加时（如肿瘤或血肿），必须有另一种成分减少才能维持 ICP 稳定。</p>\n<p>当代偿耗尽时，ICP 急剧升高，颅内压-容积曲线呈指数型上升。ICP <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>20</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mmHg</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 20\\,\\text{mmHg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mmHg</span></span></span></span></span></span> 为颅内高压，典型表现为 <strong>Cushing 三联征</strong>：高血压 + 心动过缓 + 呼吸不规则（代表脑干受压的晚期信号）。</p>\n<p>脑疝是颅内高压最危险的后果——脑组织被迫从高压腔室向低压腔室移位：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>脑疝类型</th>\n<th>疝出结构</th>\n<th>通过部位</th>\n<th>关键体征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>小脑幕切迹疝（钩回疝）</td>\n<td>颞叶钩回</td>\n<td>小脑幕切迹</td>\n<td>同侧瞳孔散大 + 对侧偏瘫</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>枕骨大孔疝（扁桃体疝）</td>\n<td>小脑扁桃体</td>\n<td>枕骨大孔</td>\n<td>呼吸骤停（压迫延髓呼吸中枢）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大脑镰下疝</td>\n<td>扣带回</td>\n<td>大脑镰下方</td>\n<td>对侧下肢无力（大脑前动脉受压）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>钩回疝的瞳孔散大机制：疝出的颞叶钩回直接压迫同侧动眼神经（第 III 对脑神经），其表面携带的副交感纤维首先受损→瞳孔括约肌麻痹→瞳孔散大、对光反射消失。这是神经外科最重要的急诊体征之一。</p>\n<h3 id=\"颅脑创伤\">颅脑创伤</h3><p>颅脑创伤（traumatic brain injury, TBI）按损伤机制分为原发性损伤（直接暴力造成的即时损伤）和继发性损伤（缺血、缺氧、脑水肿等后续病理过程）。临床严重程度用 <strong>Glasgow 昏迷量表（GCS）</strong> 评估：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反应类型</th>\n<th>最佳反应</th>\n<th>评分</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>睁眼反应（E）</td>\n<td>自发睁眼</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>言语反应（V）</td>\n<td>定向力完整</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运动反应（M）</td>\n<td>遵嘱动作</td>\n<td>6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>总分范围</strong></td>\n<td></td>\n<td><strong>3-15</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>GCS 分级：轻度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>13</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">13\\text{-}15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span>，中度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9\\text{-}12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span>，重度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\text{-}8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span>。GCS <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 通常需要气管插管保护气道。</p>\n<p>急性颅内血肿的鉴别：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>出血来源</th>\n<th>CT 表现</th>\n<th>典型病程</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>硬膜外血肿</td>\n<td>脑膜中动脉（颞骨骨折）</td>\n<td>颞部双凸形（梭形）高密度影</td>\n<td>中间清醒期→快速恶化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>急性硬膜下血肿</td>\n<td>桥静脉撕裂</td>\n<td>新月形高密度影，沿大脑凸面</td>\n<td>无清醒期，持续意识障碍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脑内血肿</td>\n<td>脑实质小血管</td>\n<td>脑实质内高密度灶</td>\n<td>进行性神经功能恶化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>硬膜外血肿的&quot;中间清醒期&quot;（lucid interval）具有诊断标志意义：患者伤后短暂昏迷→清醒（此时血肿尚未压迫到临界量）→再次昏迷（血肿扩大→脑疝）。一旦出现同侧瞳孔散大，需紧急开颅血肿清除术。</p>\n<h3 id=\"颅内肿瘤\">颅内肿瘤</h3><p>颅内肿瘤按来源分为原发性（胶质瘤、脑膜瘤、垂体腺瘤、听神经瘤等）和转移性。成人最常见的原发性脑肿瘤是胶质瘤（glioma），其中胶质母细胞瘤（GBM, WHO IV 级）恶性程度最高，中位生存期仅 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>14</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">14\\text{-}16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span> 个月。</p>\n<p>颅内肿瘤的三大症状群：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>颅内高压症状</strong>：头痛（晨起加重）、呕吐（喷射性）、视乳头水肿</li>\n<li><strong>局灶性神经功能缺失</strong>：取决于肿瘤位置——额叶（人格改变）、颞叶（言语障碍）、顶叶（感觉异常）、小脑（共济失调）</li>\n<li><strong>癫痫发作</strong>：低级别胶质瘤的首发症状中癫痫占比高达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60\\text{-}80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ol>\n<p>治疗原则根据肿瘤性质而异。GBM 采用 <strong>Stupp 方案</strong>：最大安全范围手术切除 → 替莫唑胺同步放化疗 → 替莫唑胺辅助化疗 6 个周期。脑膜瘤多为良性（WHO I 级），完全切除后复发率低。垂体腺瘤中，催乳素瘤首选药物治疗（多巴胺受体激动剂卡麦角林），无功能腺瘤和生长激素腺瘤通常需经蝶窦手术切除。</p>\n<h3 id=\"脑血管病的外科干预\">脑血管病的外科干预</h3><p><strong>颅内动脉瘤</strong>：破裂导致蛛网膜下腔出血（SAH），典型表现为&quot;雷击样&quot;剧烈头痛 + 脑膜刺激征。确诊后需尽早（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>72</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24\\text{-}72</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">72</span></span></span></span></span> h 内）处理动脉瘤以预防再出血——方式为开颅夹闭术或血管内弹簧圈栓塞术。SAH 后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\text{-}14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">14</span></span></span></span></span> 天是迟发性脑血管痉挛的高危窗口期，常规使用尼莫地平预防。</p>\n<p><strong>高血压性脑出血</strong>：基底节区出血最为常见（豆纹动脉破裂），出血量评估使用 <strong>ABC/2 公式</strong>（多田公式）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>mL</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V \\approx \\frac{A \\times B \\times C}{2}\\,(\\text{mL})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mL</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 为血肿最大层面长径（cm），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 为垂直于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 的宽径，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 为血肿层数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span> 层厚。基底节出血量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>30</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 30\\,\\text{mL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mL</span></span></span></span></span></span> 且 GCS 下降时通常考虑手术清除血肿。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>一位骑摩托车摔伤的年轻男性，伤后短暂昏迷，清醒约 2 小时后再次意识丧失，右侧瞳孔散大。CT 示右侧颞部梭形高密度影。请判断诊断并解释&quot;中间清醒期&quot;和瞳孔散大的病理生理机制。</li>\n<li>根据 Monroe-Kellie 假说，解释为什么脑肿瘤患者在早期可能没有颅内高压症状，而到一定阶段后症状突然急剧恶化。</li>\n<li>一位 50 岁女性突发剧烈头痛伴呕吐，CT 示蛛网膜下腔出血。CTA 发现前交通动脉瘤。请列出急性期管理的优先事项，并解释为什么需要尽早处理动脉瘤。</li>\n<li>对比胶质母细胞瘤和脑膜瘤在影像表现、生物学行为和治疗策略上的差异。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Youmans and Winn Neurological Surgery</strong>：神经外科百科全书式参考书。</li>\n<li><strong>Greenberg&#39;s Handbook of Neurosurgery</strong>：便携式参考手册，适合临床轮转和考试复习。</li>\n<li><strong>Radiopaedia.org</strong>：开放影像学教育平台，颅脑 CT/MRI 病例丰富，适合自学影像判读。</li>\n<li><strong>Neurosurgical Atlas</strong>（neurosurgicalatlas.com，Aaron Cohen-Gadol 主编）：手术入路和关键解剖的三维动画展示，极具教学价值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>神经外科以颅内压管理为核心——创伤、肿瘤和出血这三大类疾病最终都可能导致颅内高压和脑疝。紧急处理的目标是在不可逆脑损伤发生前解除占位效应（血肿清除、肿瘤切除或脑脊液引流）。GCS 是评估意识水平的通用工具，CT 是急诊定位颅内病变的首选影像。从硬膜外血肿的&quot;争分夺秒&quot;到胶质母细胞瘤的综合治疗，神经外科的挑战在于：手术必须在&quot;最大化病灶清除&quot;和&quot;最小化神经功能损伤&quot;之间找到精确平衡。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学临床医学 — 神经外科","id":"大学临床医学-神经外科"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"颅内压与脑疝","id":"颅内压与脑疝"},{"level":3,"text":"颅脑创伤","id":"颅脑创伤"},{"level":3,"text":"颅内肿瘤","id":"颅内肿瘤"},{"level":3,"text":"脑血管病的外科干预","id":"脑血管病的外科干预"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学临床医学 — 骨科学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/surgery/orthopedic-surgery"},"next":{"title":"大学临床医学 — 体格检查","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/diagnostics/physical-examination"}}